(footprint "ControllerJoint_ControllerEdge"
	(version 20241229)
	(generator "pcbnew")
	(generator_version "9.0")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Controller joint, controller-board side (SPEC V6 3.2/3.5, decision 0009). 10 plain SMD edge pads on F.Cu (the parts side, which faces the wall), 2.54 mm pitch, 1.3 x 2.0 mm, running to the board edge at y = 0 (the trapezoid base). Drag-soldered by hand at 90 deg to ControllerJoint_EdgeBoard on the code-0 edge board; the fillet forms between these pads and the edge board pads on the wall side. Pad n meets pad n: viewed from F.Cu with the joint edge at the bottom, pad 1 (+24V) is leftmost on both boards. Order 1..10: +24V GND +5V_LED LED_RETURN LED_DATA_OUT SPARE CANH CANL SENSE DRIVE. No pads on B.Cu, which stays plain white mask (back reflector). Pasted so reflow pre-tins them. The board needs a local copper-to-edge rule for these pads.")
	(tags "controller joint right angle board-to-board drag solder edge pads")
